### External Price Update API Tests
### 
### This file contains tests for the external price update endpoint
### The endpoint requires an API key in the X-API-Key header for authentication

@base_url = https://localhost:7294/api/products
@api_key = BatchIQ_PriceUpdate_2025_SecureKey_9dK8nF2wR7qL5xE3vM1tY6sP0jH4uA

### Update price for existing product by code
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "productCode": "123456789",
    "newPrice": 29.99,
    "notes": "Price updated via external system"
}

### Update price for non-existing product (will create new product)
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "productCode": "NEW_PRODUCT_001",
    "newPrice": 15.50
}

### Test with invalid API key (should fail)
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: invalid_key

{
    "productCode": "123456789",
    "newPrice": 29.99
}

### Test with missing API key (should fail)
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productCode": "123456789",
    "newPrice": 29.99
}

### Test with negative price (should fail)
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "productCode": "123456789",
    "newPrice": -10.00
}

### Test with empty product code (should fail)
PUT {{base_url}}/external/price-update
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
    "productCode": "",
    "newPrice": 29.99
}

### Get all auto-created products that need admin attention
### Note: This endpoint requires JWT authentication with ProductsView permission
GET {{base_url}}/auto-created
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all externally updated products
GET {{base_url}}/externally-updated
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get externally updated products since a specific date
GET {{base_url}}/externally-updated?since=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&limit=50
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Clear external update tracking for a specific product
PUT {{base_url}}/external/clear-tracking/1
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Clear external update tracking for multiple products
PUT {{base_url}}/external/clear-tracking-bulk
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "productIds": [1, 2, 3],
    "updatedSince": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}
